  "comments": "Bernardo O&#039;Higgins Riquelme (1778–1842) was a Chilean independence leader who, along with José de San Martín, freed Chile from Spanish rule in the Chilean War of Independence.<br /><br />\r\nTwo main groups and a year variety are known.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - wreath and denomination closer to center, date wider.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - wreath and denomination closer to rim, date narrower.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61b3d4208493d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61b3d4208493d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">1986</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A1</span> - tall numerals in date.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A2</span> - squat numerals in date.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5927b9d5d95e2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5927b9d5d95e2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"90\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1981-1985, 1986 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A1</span>, 1986 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A2</span>, 1987.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1988-1992.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Notes</span>:<br />\r\n1. The position and wideness of the date differs from year to year, though the wreath is the same on coins from the same group.<br />\r\n2. In 1992 there were coins of two emissions: this one and the next, smaller in aluminum (N# 1866).<br />\r\n3. Correspondence with Standard Catalog of Worlds coins<br />\r\nKM#216.1: dies <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>, 1986 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A1</span>, 1986 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A2</span>;<br />\r\nKM#216.2: die <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>.",
